msgid "Secret Key:"
msgstr "Secret Key:"

#: src/class-tumblr-import.php:317
msgid "As Tumblr does not expose the \"author\", even from multi-author blogs you will need to select which WordPress user will be listed as the author of the imported posts."
msgstr "As Tumblr does not expose the \"author\", even from multi-author blogs you will need to select which WordPress user will be listed as the author of the imported posts."

#: src/class-tumblr-import.php:417
msgid "If your import gets stuck for a long time or you would like to import from a different Tumblr account instead then click on the \"Clear account information\" button below to reset the importer."
msgstr "If your import gets stuck for a long time or you would like to import from a different Tumblr account instead then click on the \"Clear account information\" button below to reset the importer."

